nd total. Do not silently include questionable amounts. Save the usable report and a short handoff explaining how to run it\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;110mand any data problems. Verify the actual output before you hand it over; work directly for now.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 2 steps \u00b7 8 tool calls \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;243m\u2514 \u001b[38;5;103mOne finance requirement while you work: they import CSV, so include a machine-readable category summary with exact cents, not just a\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;103mMarkdown report. Keep the original source file unchanged and make any excluded rows obvious in the handoff.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252minspecting \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/report.py\u001b\\report.py\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\, tests, and CSV directly via bash\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 1 tool call \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mrunning the report and test suite to verify against the live CSV\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 2 steps \u00b7 4 tool calls \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m\r\n                                                                                                                                           \u001b[38;5;252m\u276e\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;252mwriting the handoff, then fixing the three fixture-dependent tests\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 3 tool calls \u00b7 ctrl+e\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mcleaning the bytecode cache and doing a final check of the artifacts\u001b[39m\r\n    \u001b[38;5;243m\u25b8 worked \u00b7 1 tool call \u00b7 ctrl+e\r\n\r\n\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;5;252mdone\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252mThe report is saved and verified against the live CSV; the source file is untouched.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;252mNumbers (provisional \u2014 see below):\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m books 25.00, food 18.40 \u2212 3.40 = 15.00, travel\u001b[39m\r\n  \u001b[38;5;252m120.00, grand total 160.00. Exact cents, \u001b[48;5;234mDecimal\u001b[49m arithmetic, sorted by category name.\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;252mFiles written\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m (all under \u001b[4m\u001b]8;;file:///tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project\u001b\\/tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project/\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;252m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\):\u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\u001b[38;5;243m\u2193 latest \u00b7 ctrl+l\u001b[39m\r\n\u001b[38;5;243m\u2500 \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;116mdeepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash\u001b[0m\u001b[38;5;243m:auto \u00b7 \u001b[38;5;173m\u25c7 YOLO\u001b[38;5;243m \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 \u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;243m$0.26 \u00b7 \u27f2 saved $0.0995 \u00b7 87% cached   43.6k/1M \u00b7 4%\u001b[39m   \u001b[38;5;243midle \u2500\r\n\u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;243m\u203a \u001b[39m\r\n\r\n\r\n \u001b[38;5;116malt+l\u001b[38;5;243m tasks\u001b[39m                                                                \u001b[38;5;243mproject: /tmp/codeaf-sustained-1607/final/reimbursement-project\u001b[39m"]
